WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.442 --> 00:00:15.353
The lion demon rubbed his aching mouth.

2
00:00:17.035 --> 00:00:18.896
leave the Tang Monk alone.

3
00:00:19.717 --> 00:00:21.819
Wukong is dangerous."

4
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:23.601
The raptor nodded.

5
00:00:23.621 --> 00:00:27.144
"Bah!" The elephant demon waved his hand.

6
00:00:28.176 --> 00:00:30.337
"I'm not afraid of that silly monkey.

7
00:00:31.578 --> 00:00:35.139
I have a perfect plan to defeat him and capture the Tang Monk."

8
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.961
The lion shook his head.

9
00:00:37.981 --> 00:00:43.723
"The last time you had a plan, I wound up with a broken tooth."

10
00:00:46.024 --> 00:00:46.965
elephant snorted.

11
00:00:46.985 --> 00:00:49.066
"Just leave everything to me."

12
00:00:52.847 --> 00:00:54.188
returned to his companions.

13
00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.042
He heard Bajie and Wujing arguing.

14
00:00:59.163 --> 00:01:00.203
can't go home!"

15
00:01:00.564 --> 00:01:01.464
shouted Wujing.

16
00:01:02.225 --> 00:01:03.986
"We're on an important journey."

17
00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:08.930
"But Wukong got eaten by the lion demon," said Bajie.

18
00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:14.834
"Without Wukong, we'll never get to the Western Paradise."

19
00:01:14.854 --> 00:01:16.375
"Here I am!"

20
00:01:16.695 --> 00:01:17.436
said the monkey.

21
00:01:18.236 --> 00:01:19.517
Everyone spun around.

22
00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:21.699
"You're alive!"

23
00:01:21.959 --> 00:01:22.960
cried the Tang Monk.

24
00:01:24.032 --> 00:01:26.073
"Yes, I am," said Wukong.

25
00:01:26.093 --> 00:01:29.675
"I beat up that lion's insides and broke one of his teeth.

26
00:01:30.496 --> 00:01:32.157
The demons are scared of me now.

27
00:01:32.877 --> 00:01:35.218
They promised to let us cross their mountain safely."

28
00:01:35.238 --> 00:01:38.580
"That's wonderful," said the Tang Monk.

29
00:01:40.421 --> 00:01:42.823
Wujing helped the monk climb onto the horse.

30
00:01:43.743 --> 00:01:45.444
The other travelers started walking.

31
00:01:47.085 --> 00:01:51.628
They hadn't gone far when they saw a large figure ahead, blocking the road.

32
00:01:53.972 --> 00:01:56.973
"That's the elephant demon," said Wukong with a frown.

33
00:01:56.993 --> 00:01:58.894
"What's he doing here?"

34
00:01:58.914 --> 00:02:01.915
"We want the Tang Monk!"

35
00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.376
shouted the elephant.

36
00:02:05.217 --> 00:02:06.557
The Tang Monk fainted.

37
00:02:08.158 --> 00:02:09.158
turned to Bajie.

38
00:02:09.178 --> 00:02:12.259
"I've been dealing with these demons all day.

39
00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.221
It's your turn to fight them."

40
00:02:17.762 --> 00:02:19.222
sighed. "Okay."

41
00:02:20.263 --> 00:02:24.228
Waving his rake, the pig charged toward the elephant.

42
00:02:24.288 --> 00:02:26.029
"You'll never harm my master!"

43
00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:31.511
The elephant blocked the rake, spun around, and struck back.

44
00:02:32.512 --> 00:02:33.952
Bajie jumped out of the way.

45
00:02:35.433 --> 00:02:38.394
The elephant jerked his head, and his trunk shot out.

46
00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:44.616
Before Bajie could duck, the trunk wrapped tightly around his body.

47
00:02:45.257 --> 00:02:49.118
As the elephant ran off with Bajie, Wukong groaned.

48
00:02:51.119 --> 00:02:52.780
The monkey turned to his companions.

49
00:02:53.692 --> 00:02:54.413
two wait here.

50
00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:56.295
I'll go save the pig."

51
00:03:00.518 --> 00:03:04.562
Wukong returned to the demons' cave and turned into a fly.

52
00:03:08.085 --> 00:03:10.387
He found Bajie deep inside the cave.

53
00:03:11.688 --> 00:03:15.211
The pig was tied up, floating in a tub of salt water.

54
00:03:15.231 --> 00:03:20.156
Wukong changed back into himself and untied his companion.

55
00:03:23.044 --> 00:03:24.345
you," said Bajie.

56
00:03:24.365 --> 00:03:26.865
"Those demons were planning to pickle me!"

57
00:03:28.766 --> 00:03:30.986
welcome, Bajie," said Wukong.

58
00:03:31.006 --> 00:03:32.587
"Now let's—whaa!"

59
00:03:33.627 --> 00:03:36.708
The elephant's trunk wrapped tightly around Wukong's chest.

60
00:03:37.548 --> 00:03:40.169
Then the elephant stepped out of a dark corner.

61
00:03:40.189 --> 00:03:44.170
"I knew you'd come to save your friend," said the elephant.

62
00:03:45.231 --> 00:03:46.911
you can't protect the Tang Monk.

63
00:03:47.651 --> 00:03:51.064
My trunk is very strong!"

64
00:03:51.184 --> 00:03:52.825
Wukong's arms were still free.

65
00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:56.287
He pulled out his iron bar, which instantly grew.

66
00:03:57.048 --> 00:04:00.750
With all his strength, he slammed it down on the elephant's trunk.

67
00:04:02.511 --> 00:04:03.391
Ow! Ow!"

68
00:04:03.591 --> 00:04:04.472
the elephant cried.

69
00:04:05.172 --> 00:04:07.153
He released Wukong and fell backward.

70
00:04:08.154 --> 00:04:10.795
His trunk had a horrible purple bruise.

71
00:04:11.776 --> 00:04:15.818
Wukong moved toward the elephant, his iron bar raised high.

72
00:04:16.619 --> 00:04:18.400
The elephant's eyes went wide.

73
00:04:20.076 --> 00:04:21.237
don't hurt me anymore!

74
00:04:22.018 --> 00:04:24.039
We'll let the Tang Monk cross the mountain!"

75
00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.582
The monkey glared at the elephant for a moment.

76
00:04:28.582 --> 00:04:30.083
he put the iron bar away.

77
00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:32.745
"You'd better not trick us again."

78
00:04:34.527 --> 00:04:38.289
Wukong and Bajie left the cave and returned to their companions.

79
00:04:40.651 --> 00:04:42.452
The group continued over the mountain.

80
00:04:43.473 --> 00:04:47.616
As the travelers came around a bend, they saw the lion and the elephant.

81
00:04:48.436 --> 00:04:50.698
The two demons were blocking the road.

82
00:04:53.941 --> 00:04:54.802
stomped toward them.

83
00:04:58.445 --> 00:04:59.566
"What are you doing?

84
00:04:59.886 --> 00:05:02.408
You promised "Wukong, help us!"

85
00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:03.689
cried the Tang Monk.

86
00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.691
Wukong spun around.

87
00:05:06.592 --> 00:05:10.115
The raptor had grabbed the monkey's companions with its talons.

88
00:05:10.816 --> 00:05:15.340
With a powerful flap of its wings, the giant bird flew away.
